<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1999</h1><p class="ref-lede">1999 in world history: 21 events, 13 deaths and 1 state that came to an end. 258 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
