<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/venezuela"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Venezuela.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Venezuela</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A new constitution creates the Bolivarian Republic of Venezuela</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-panama"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Panama.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Panama</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Panama takes full control of the canal on 31 December</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/hungary"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hungary.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hungary</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hungary joins NATO.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-morocco"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Morocco.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Morocco</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hassan II dies and is succeeded by his son Mohammed VI, who sets up the Equity and Reconciliation Commission to examine his father's abuses.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/islamic-republic-of-pakistan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Islamic%20Republic%20of%20Pakistan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Islamic Republic of Pakistan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Kargil War brings Pakistan and India to the brink, and General Pervez Musharraf takes power in a bloodless coup.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/east-timor"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/East%20Timor.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>East Timor</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A UN-supervised referendum votes clearly for independence; pro-integration militias backed by the Indonesian military answer with a campaign of violence, and INTERFET lands to restore order.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/inuit"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Inuit.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Inuit</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Nunavut is established as a territory of Canada under the Nunavut Land Claims Agreement of 1993</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/anarchism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Anarchism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Anarchism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Anarchists, leading networks of the anti-globalisation movement, take part in the confrontations at the Seattle WTO conference</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/terracotta-army"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Terracotta%20Army.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Terracotta Army</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Excavation of Pit K9901 uncovers the figures dubbed the Acrobats</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/nelson-mandela"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Nelson%20Mandela.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Nelson Mandela</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He retires after one term and is succeeded by his deputy, Thabo Mbeki</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/beowulf"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Beowulf.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Beowulf</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Seamus Heaney's verse translation is published</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/federal-republic-of-yugoslavia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Federal%20Republic%20of%20Yugoslavia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Federal Republic of Yugoslavia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">NATO bombs Yugoslavia, and Security Council Resolution 1244 places Kosovo under a United Nations mission</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/golden-temple"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Golden%20Temple.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Golden Temple</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Sikhs rebuilt the Akal Takht Sahib, after repairs ordered in 1986 were removed</span></li></ul></section>
